{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the swarm in space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against endless enemies while piloting your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and grow stronger each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/b0e3953034fead1d027c02208de6c4be.avif?t=1755836345\" width=600 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your module loadout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with countless module combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different with roguelike upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/36c5cc07891a8041e27feeefa7151960.avif?t=1755836345\" width=600 height=290 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascend and grow even stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Prisms when you ascend based on your highest cleared sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend them to unlock permanent upgrades in the ascension tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/085f4e390e058b5900fd58c66c00c5e0.avif?t=1755836345\" width=600 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Defeat swarming enemies to collect Halos and Crystals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Unlock and combine modules for unique builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Face harder waves as you push through sectors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Ascend to reset your run and spend Prisms on permanent upgrades</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022 Fa